Lineage and attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

jax-evogym is a JAX-native reimplementation of Evolution Gym (EvoGym), a
benchmark for evolving and controlling soft-body robots.

  Evolution Gym
  https://github.com/EvolutionGym/evogym
  Copyright (c) 2022 jagdeepsb
  Distributed under the MIT License (reproduced below).

Portions of this project are derived from Evolution Gym, including the physics
parameterization of the soft-body / mass-spring model and the reference
simulation traces under tests/reference_data/ that are used for parity
validation. Those reference traces were generated with the original Evolution
Gym C++ simulator.

If you use jax-evogym in research, please also cite the original work:

  Jagdeep Bhatia, Holly Jackson, Yunsheng Tian, Jie Xu, and Wojciech Matusik.
  "Evolution Gym: A Large-Scale Benchmark for Evolving Soft Robots."
  Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2021.

